{"id": "lobbyists-gave-to-officials-they-lobbied", "title": "After the ban, lobbyists still report money for officials they lobby", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.049, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "df7aeb276d3632d2", "words": 406, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A lobbyist is paid to win over City officials.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.53, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The 2018 ban", "sub": "adopted by voters in 2016"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 0.73, 0.95, 1.08, 1.33, 1.55, 1.8]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Since January 1, 2018, a lobbyist can’t give campaign money to the officials they lobby.", "t0": 2.65, "t1": 8.12, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The 2018 ban", "sub": "adopted by voters in 2016"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.86, 1.32, 1.64, 2.52, 2.66, 3.1, 3.37, 3.58, 4.07, 4.3, 4.41, 4.54, 4.95, 5.13]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "So did the money stop?", "t0": 8.24, "t1": 9.6, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["peak year", "331"], "b": ["since 2018", "119"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.3, 0.4, 0.62]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "We matched lobbyists’ own reports: who they contacted, and who they gave to.", "t0": 9.6, "t1": 13.8, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["peak year", "331"], "b": ["since 2018", "119"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.51, 0.96, 1.12, 1.94, 2.15, 2.31, 3.05, 3.27, 3.46, 3.64, 3.9]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "Since the ban, how many gifts went to someone the same lobbyist contacted within a year?", "t0": 13.92, "t1": 18.8, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["peak year", "331"], "b": ["since 2018", "119"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.38, 1.05, 1.22, 1.43, 1.71, 1.87, 1.99, 2.4, 2.52, 2.78, 3.22, 3.74, 4.01, 4.09]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "amount"], "text": "119.", "t0": 18.8, "t1": 19.85, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "119", "label": "contributions, worth $94,975", "sub": "worth $94,975"}, "emph": ["119"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.52]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "That’s 94,975 dollars. This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 20.37, "t1": 25.77, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.89, 1.36, 1.61, 1.91, 2.53, 3.46, 3.73, 3.87, 3.99, 4.65, 4.88, 4.96]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[2]"], "text": "The first lead is the most direct.", "t0": 25.99, "t1": 27.54, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City campaigns", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "$33,775"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.42, 0.66, 0.78, 0.92, 1.16]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[2]"], "text": "96 of those gifts went straight to City campaigns, worth 33,775 dollars.", "t0": 27.66, "t1": 33.55, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City campaigns", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "$33,775"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.65, 0.88, 1.15, 1.35, 1.7, 1.81, 2.07, 3.01, 3.27, 3.85, 4.29, 4.59, 4.86, 5.47]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[2]"], "text": "That’s the kind of gift the ban was written to stop.", "t0": 33.67, "t1": 35.84, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City campaigns", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "$33,775"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.36, 0.58, 0.67, 0.89, 1.01, 1.3, 1.45, 1.71, 1.81]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The ban only applies if the lobbyist was registered to lobby that official’s agency at the time.", "t0": 35.96, "t1": 40.37, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "registered to lobby that official’s agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.66, 1.12, 1.22, 1.36, 1.79, 1.96, 2.42, 2.54, 2.86, 3.04, 3.45, 3.86, 3.94, 4.06]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "These filings don’t say.", "t0": 40.49, "t1": 41.72, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "registered to lobby that official’s agency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.63, 0.86]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "The second lead is a single day: May 23, 2024.", "t0": 41.94, "t1": 45.43, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-05-23", "to": "2024-05-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "one report", "toLab": "one day", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.66, 0.78, 0.86, 1.18, 1.8, 2.01, 2.58, 2.87]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "One Platinum Advisors lobbyist reported gifts to London Breed’s campaign. How many?", "t0": 45.55, "t1": 50.5, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-05-23", "to": "2024-05-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "one report", "toLab": "one day", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.61, 1.12, 1.56, 1.99, 2.25, 2.38, 2.68, 2.98, 3.96, 4.18]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "26.", "t0": 50.5, "t1": 51.28, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "26", "label": "contributions, each from someone else", "sub": "each $500 or less"}, "emph": ["26"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Each one names another person as the source.", "t0": 51.8, "t1": 53.79, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "bundling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.45, 0.7, 1.02, 1.34, 1.46, 1.56]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Collecting other people’s checks for an official you lobby is called bundling, and the rule bars it.", "t0": 53.91, "t1": 58.4, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "bundling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.65, 0.99, 1.28, 1.43, 1.51, 1.91, 2.07, 2.39, 2.52, 2.78, 3.42, 3.62, 3.76, 4.02, 4.35]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Or the lobbyist may have reported gifts made at their request. The filing doesn’t say which.", "t0": 58.52, "t1": 63.37, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "bundling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.35, 0.83, 1.02, 1.15, 1.57, 1.88, 2.06, 2.15, 2.33, 3.24, 3.43, 3.87, 4.19, 4.48]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "The third lead is a side door.", "t0": 63.59, "t1": 65.09, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Democratic Party board", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "15 contributions, $18,500"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.69, 0.82, 0.91, 1.21]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "Supervisors also run for a seat on the local Democratic Party board.", "t0": 65.21, "t1": 68.51, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Democratic Party board", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "15 contributions, $18,500"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.75, 1.03, 1.23, 1.39, 1.46, 1.69, 1.79, 1.9, 2.18, 2.7, 2.97]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "Lobbyists gave 15 gifts to those campaigns, worth 18,500 dollars.", "t0": 68.63, "t1": 73.14, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Democratic Party board", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "15 contributions, $18,500"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.7, 1.14, 1.4, 1.5, 1.7, 2.48, 2.76, 3.15, 3.58, 3.85, 4.1]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Party-board campaigns have no 500 dollar limit, and the lobbyist ban doesn’t cover them.", "t0": 73.26, "t1": 77.82, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "outside the lobbyist ban"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 1.02, 1.17, 1.36, 1.61, 1.86, 2.16, 2.68, 2.89, 3.01, 3.47, 3.78, 4.07, 4.34]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The biggest: 5,000 dollars from a Platinum Advisors lobbyist to Shamann Walton’s committee,", "t0": 77.94, "t1": 82.92, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2019-12-31", "to": "2020-01-13", "days": "13", "fromLab": "$5,000 gift", "toLab": "lobbyist contact", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.93, 1.23, 1.58, 1.9, 2.08, 2.16, 2.56, 3.08, 3.54, 3.67, 4.08, 4.45]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "on December 31, 2019.", "t0": 82.92, "t1": 85.5, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2019-12-31", "to": "2020-01-13", "days": "13", "fromLab": "$5,000 gift", "toLab": "lobbyist contact", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.7, 1.61, 1.97]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "How many days until their next reported contact with Walton?", "t0": 85.62, "t1": 88.97, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2019-12-31", "to": "2020-01-13", "days": "13", "fromLab": "$5,000 gift", "toLab": "lobbyist contact", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.41, 0.71, 0.97, 1.17, 1.4, 1.81, 2.27, 2.43]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "13 days.", "t0": 88.97, "t1": 89.96, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "13 days", "label": "gift to contact"}, "emph": ["13"], "wt": [0.04, 0.57]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "The fourth lead is independent committees, which can take unlimited money.", "t0": 90.58, "t1": 93.88, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Independent committees", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "3 contributions, $25,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.44, 0.64, 0.76, 1.24, 1.9, 2.11, 2.25, 2.53, 3.02]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "3 gifts went to ones tied to an official the lobbyist contacted: 25,000 dollars.", "t0": 94.0, "t1": 98.8, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Independent committees", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "3 contributions, $25,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.52, 0.71, 0.84, 1.08, 1.32, 1.45, 1.54, 1.93, 2.05, 2.48, 3.39, 4.05, 4.42]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The largest was 10,000 dollars from New Deal Advisers, to a committee for London Breed.", "t0": 98.92, "t1": 103.35, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "San Francisco For London Breed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.52, 0.69, 0.91, 1.29, 1.62, 1.78, 1.94, 2.15, 2.91, 3.11, 3.2, 3.58, 3.74, 4.06]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Breed couldn’t control it. But she would know who paid.", "t0": 103.47, "t1": 106.21, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "San Francisco For London Breed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.55, 0.98, 1.46, 1.65, 1.81, 2.05, 2.2, 2.37]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "suspicious[4].what"], "text": "The fifth lead is timing: 24 of those gifts came within 30 days of a contact.", "t0": 106.43, "t1": 110.89, "shot": "b5x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "24", "label": "of the 119 contributions within 30 days of a contact", "sub": "4 within a week", "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "emph": ["24"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.64, 0.75, 1.48, 2.02, 2.1, 2.36, 2.65, 2.88, 3.16, 3.51, 3.8, 3.9, 3.98]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why", "innocent[2]"], "text": "Moving every date a year either way gives 11. About twice the calendar, on small numbers.", "t0": 111.01, "t1": 115.88, "shot": "b5y", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["within 30 days of a contact", "24"], "b": ["every date moved a year either way", "11"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.56, 0.79, 0.88, 1.1, 1.36, 1.61, 1.85, 2.65, 2.96, 3.26, 3.36, 3.96, 4.2, 4.49]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Nothing here shows a gift broke the rule, or that any official acted because of one.", "t0": 116.1, "t1": 120.05, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any gift broke the rule", "That any official acted because of a gift"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.59, 0.88, 0.97, 1.19, 1.42, 1.54, 2.05, 2.26, 2.42, 2.59, 3.0, 3.28, 3.61, 3.72]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? Which agencies each lobbyist was registered to lobby on each date.", "t0": 120.17, "t1": 124.46, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Which agencies each lobbyist was registered to lobby"}, {"who": "", "what": "Whether any gift was returned"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.36, 0.67, 1.2, 1.47, 1.99, 2.2, 2.63, 2.82, 3.27, 3.37, 3.71, 3.85, 4.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "No enforcement action has been found for these filings.", "t0": 124.58, "t1": 127.01, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.74, 1.02, 1.14, 1.33, 1.59, 1.7, 1.88]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.13, "t1": 129.36, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.36, 0.47, 0.55, 1.24, 1.46, 1.56]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Lead 1 · 96 to City campaigns", "lead2": "Lead 2 · 26 in one day", "lead3": "Lead 3 · the party side door", "lead4": "Lead 4 · $25,00